{"id":"n26795-1-3","stage":0,"title":"가장 · 最","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26795-1-3-1","ko":"너희 중에서 누가 가장 키가 크니?","zh":"你们当中谁个子最高啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너희","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"1","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"중에서","meaning":"当中","explanation":"중：当中；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"1","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"누가","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가장","meaning":"最","explanation":"가장：最","readings":[{"term":"가장","audio":"/audio/8fd32c9572450a80df7d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26795","senseId":"1","lemma":"가장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"키가","meaning":"身高，身长，个子，个儿，个头儿","explanation":"키：身高，身长，个子，个儿，个头儿；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"키","audio":"/audio/e37db65fd90db469af33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20269","senseId":"1","lemma":"키","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"크니?","meaning":"大，高，长，壮阔","explanation":"크다：大，高，长，壮阔；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"1","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指代多个听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너히"]},{"id":"b558d7af71515538","term":"중","zh":"当中","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3","entryId":"79404","definition":"多个中。","pronunciation":["중"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指不认识的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"8fd32c9572450a80","term":"가장","zh":"最","audio":"/audio/8fd32c9572450a80df7d.mp3","entryId":"26795","definition":"多个中占第一。","pronunciation":["가장"]},{"id":"e37db65fd90db469","term":"키","zh":"身高，身长，个子，个儿，个头儿","audio":"/audio/e37db65fd90db469af33.mp3","entryId":"20269","definition":"人或动物站直时从脚到头的身体的长度。","pronunciation":["키"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"大，高，长，壮阔","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"长度、宽度、高度、体积等都超出了普通程度。","pronunciation":["크다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c871423c5840577d9e4b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26795-1-3-2","ko":"승규가 우리 반에서 키가 제일 커요.","zh":"承奎是我们班里个子最高的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규가","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们","explanation":"우리：我们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"2","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"반에서","meaning":"班，班级","explanation":"반：班，班级；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"반","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57301","senseId":"2","lemma":"반","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"키가","meaning":"身高，身长，个子，个儿，个头儿","explanation":"키：身高，身长，个子，个儿，个头儿；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"키","audio":"/audio/e37db65fd90db469af33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20269","senseId":"1","lemma":"키","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제일","meaning":"最","explanation":"제일：最","readings":[{"term":"제일","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92032","senseId":"1","lemma":"제일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"커요.","meaning":"大，高，长，壮阔","explanation":"크다：大，高，长，壮阔；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio"